# FU App Design System Specification

> Extracted from existing Home Screen components ([HomeHeader](file:///Users/ahmedmansour/Documents/GitHub/fu-app/src/components/home/HomeHeader.tsx#8-59), [AIDesignSlider](file:///Users/ahmedmansour/Documents/GitHub/fu-app/src/components/home/AIDesignSlider.tsx#38-126), [FeaturesSection](file:///Users/ahmedmansour/Documents/GitHub/fu-app/src/components/home/FeaturesSection.tsx#35-66), [CategoriesSection](file:///Users/ahmedmansour/Documents/GitHub/fu-app/src/components/home/CategoriesSection.tsx#15-61), [ProductCard](file:///Users/ahmedmansour/Documents/GitHub/fu-app/src/components/home/ProductCard.tsx#17-91), [ProductListSection](file:///Users/ahmedmansour/Documents/GitHub/fu-app/src/components/home/ProductListSection.tsx#25-69))

---

## 1. Color Palette

### Primary Colors
| Token | Value | Usage |
|-------|-------|-------|
| **Primary** | `#1E3A5F` | Main brand color (buttons, links, icons, selected states) |
| **Primary Dark** | `#102A43` | Darker shade for pressed/active states |
| **Accent** | `#F59E0B` | Gold/Amber for highlights (optional) |

### Neutral Colors
| Token | Value | Usage |
|-------|-------|-------|
| **Background** | `#F5F5F5` | Main app background |
| **Surface** | `#FFFFFF` | Card/component backgrounds |
| **Surface Alt** | `#F8FAFC` (`slate-50`) | Subtle backgrounds, icon containers |
| **Border** | `#E5E7EB` | Default borders |
| **Border Light** | `#F1F5F9` (`slate-100`) | Subtle borders |

### Text Colors
| Token | Value | Usage |
|-------|-------|-------|
| **Text Primary** | `#1E293B` (`slate-800`) | Main headings and body text |
| **Text Secondary** | `#64748B` (`slate-500`) | Supporting/muted text |
| **Text Light** | `#757575` | Captions, placeholders |
| **Text Inverse** | `#FFFFFF` | Text on dark/primary backgrounds |

### Semantic Colors
| Token | Value | Usage |
|-------|-------|-------|
| **Error/Discount** | `#EF4444` (`red-500`) | Errors, discount badges, favorite icons |
| **Success** | `#22C55E` (`green-500`) | Success states, completed steps |

---

## 2. Typography

### Font Family
- **Primary Font**: `Cairo` (Arabic-optimized, Google Fonts)
  - `Cairo_400Regular` → `font-cairo`
  - `Cairo_500Medium` → `font-cairo-medium`
  - `Cairo_700Bold` → `font-cairo-bold`

### Font Sizes (Tailwind)
| Token | Class | Size |
|-------|-------|------|
| **xs** | `text-xs` | 12px |
| **sm** | `text-sm` | 14px |
| **base** | `text-base` | 16px |
| **lg** | `text-lg` | 18px |
| **xl** | `text-xl` | 20px |
| **2xl** | `text-2xl` | 24px |

### Text Styles
| Style | Size | Weight | Usage |
|-------|------|--------|-------|
| **Page Title** | `text-2xl` | `font-cairo-bold` | Section headings |
| **Section Title** | `text-base` | `font-cairo-bold` | Product list headers |
| **Card Title** | `text-xs` | `font-cairo-medium` | Product names |
| **Price** | `text-sm` | `font-cairo-bold` | Product prices (Primary color) |
| **Caption** | `text-xs` | `font-cairo-medium` | Labels, categories |
| **CTA Button** | `text-sm` | `font-cairo-bold` | Button text |

### Text Alignment
- **Default**: `text-right` (RTL)
- **Centered**: For badges, icon labels

---

## 3. Spacing System

### Base Unit
- Base spacing unit: **4px**

### Spacing Scale (Tailwind)
| Token | Tailwind | Value |
|-------|----------|-------|
| **0.5** | `p-0.5` | 2px |
| **1** | `p-1` | 4px |
| **1.5** | `p-1.5` | 6px |
| **2** | `p-2` | 8px |
| **3** | `p-3` | 12px |
| **4** | `p-4` | 16px |
| **5** | `p-5` | 20px |
| **6** | `p-6` | 24px |
| **8** | `p-8` | 32px |

### Component Spacing
| Component | Spacing |
|-----------|---------|
| **Screen Padding** | `px-5` (20px) |
| **Section Margin** | `mb-6` to `mb-8` |
| **Card Padding** | `p-3` (12px) |
| **Item Gap (horizontal)** | `gap-3` or `ml-3` |
| **Icon Container Size** | `w-16 h-16` (64px) for Features, `w-10 h-10` (40px) for Actions |

---

## 4. Border Radius

| Token | Tailwind | Value | Usage |
|-------|----------|-------|-------|
| **Small** | `rounded` | 4px | Badges |
| **Medium** | `rounded-xl` | 12px | Cards, buttons |
| **Large** | `rounded-2xl` | 16px | Sliders, modals |
| **XL** | `rounded-3xl` | 24px | Feature icons, style cards |
| **Full** | `rounded-full` | 9999px | Avatars, category circles, pills |

### Component-Specific Radius
| Component | Radius |
|-----------|--------|
| **ProductCard** | `rounded-xl` |
| **Feature Icon** | `rounded-3xl` |
| **Category Avatar** | `rounded-full` |
| **Slider** | `rounded-2xl` |
| **Buttons** | `rounded-full` (pill) or `rounded-2xl` |

---

## 5. Shadows

> **Design Philosophy**: Minimal shadows. Borders are preferred for definition.

| Token | Usage | Value |
|-------|-------|-------|
| **None** | Default for cards | No shadow |
| **Light** | Optional hover | `shadow-sm` |
| **Border Definition** | Primary | `border border-gray-100` or `border-slate-100` |

---

