| Background | `bg-white` |
| Border | `border border-gray-100` |
| Border Radius | `rounded-xl` |
| Image Height | `h-[170px]` (1:1 aspect) |
| Content Padding | `px-3 pb-3` |

**Feature Icon Card**
| Property | Value |
|----------|-------|
