| Background | `bg-slate-50` |
| Border | `border border-slate-100` |
| Border Radius | `rounded-3xl` |

**Category Circle**
| Property | Value |
|----------|-------|
| Size | `w-[70px] h-[70px]` |
| Border | `border-2` (transparent default, Primary when selected) |
