## 7. RTL (Right-to-Left) Support

### Layout Direction
- **Flex Row**: Use `flex-row-reverse` for horizontal layouts
- **ScrollViews**: Apply `style={{ transform: [{ scaleX: -1 }] }}` to container, then `transform: [{ scaleX: -1 }]` to each item
- **Text Alignment**: Default `text-right`

### Consistent Patterns
```tsx
// Horizontal Scroll (RTL)
<ScrollView
    horizontal
    style={{ transform: [{ scaleX: -1 }] }}
>
    {items.map(item => (
        <View style={{ transform: [{ scaleX: -1 }] }}>
            {/* content */}
        </View>
    ))}
</ScrollView>
```

---

## 8. Icons

- **Icon Set**: `@expo/vector-icons` (Feather, Ionicons)
- **Default Size**: 22-24px
- **Small**: 16px (badges, secondary actions)
- **Default Color**: `COLORS.primary` or `slate-500`

---

## 9. Animation & Transitions

> **Philosophy**: Subtle, fast transitions. No heavy animations.

| Property | Value |
|----------|-------|
| **Duration** | 200-300ms |
| **Active Opacity** | `activeOpacity={0.9}` |
| **Active State** | `active:bg-gray-100` |

---

## 10. Quick Reference: Tailwind Classes

### Common Card
```tsx
className="bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-100"
```

### Primary Button
```tsx
className="bg-primary py-4 rounded-2xl"
// Text: "text-white font-cairo-bold"
```

### Feature Icon
```tsx
className="w-16 h-16 rounded-3xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-100 items-center justify-center"
```

### Section Header
```tsx
className="flex-row-reverse justify-between items-center px-5 mb-4"
// Title: "text-base font-cairo-bold text-slate-800"
// Link: "text-sm font-cairo-medium text-slate-500"
```

---

## Notes & Guidelines

1. **No Shadows**: Prefer clean borders over drop shadows for a flat, modern look.
2. **Consistent Padding**: Always use `px-5` (20px) for screen-level horizontal padding.
3. **Cairo Font**: All text must use Cairo font classes for Arabic readability.
4. **RTL First**: Design for Right-to-Left layout by default.
5. **Primary Color**: `#1E3A5F` (Dark Blue) is the signature brand color.
